<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>瑶瑶，我想对你说 ❤</title>
<style is:inline>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff0f3 0%, #ffe4ec 45%, #ffd6e8 100%);
    color: #5b2333;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  #hearts { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; }
  .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 20px 80px; text-align: center; }
  .big-heart { font-size: 72px; animation: beat 1.2s ease-in-out infinite; display: inline-block; }
  @keyframes beat { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 30% { transform: scale(1.25); } 45% { transform: scale(1.05); } }
  h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 16px 0 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .subtitle { color: #a34a63; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .story { text-align: left; background: rgba(255,255,255,.65); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px 26px; line-height: 2; font-size: 1.02rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255, 107, 139, .15); }
  .story p { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .story p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .story .highlight { color: #e5486b; font-weight: 600; }
  .question { margin-top: 48px; }
  .question h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .question p { color: #a34a63; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .btns { position: relative; height: 64px; }
  button { border: none; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 14px 34px; transition: transform .2s; }
  #yes { background: #ff5c7a; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255, 92, 122, .45); }
  #yes:hover { transform: scale(1.08); }
  #no { background: #fff; color: #a34a63; border: 2px solid #ffc2d1; position: absolute; left: 62%; top: 0; }
  #result { display: none; margin-top: 40px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.75); border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px 24px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255, 107, 139, .2); }
  #result h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; color: #e5486b; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  #result p { line-height: 1.9; color: #5b2333; }
  .sign { margin-top: 56px; color: #a34a63; font-size: .95rem; }
  .sign b { color: #e5486b; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="hearts"></canvas>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="big-heart">❤</div>
  <h1>瑶瑶，我想对你说</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">这个页面，是我专门为你做的</p>

  <div class="story">
    <p>以前的我，一直是一个人生活，享受着孤独，也憧憬着爱情。</p>
    <p>一个人的长廊，一个人的山岗，一个人的地铁，一个人的游乐场——但我依然乐观，微笑着，等待着。</p>
    <p>直到有一天，我遇见了你，<span class="highlight">瑶瑶</span>。</p>
    <p>你的出现，让我的世界一下子有了颜色。跟你在一起的每一天，连平平无奇的日子都变得值得期待。</p>
    <p>我想和你一起去很多地方玩，一起吃遍好吃的东西，一起把平凡的日子过成值得纪念的日子。</p>
    <p>比时间多一秒就是永远——<span class="highlight">我想把这个永远，留给你。</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="question" id="question">
    <h2>瑶瑶，你愿意一直陪着我吗？</h2>
    <p>认真想想再回答哦（不过有一个按钮好像不太听话）</p>
    <div class="btns">
      <button id="yes">愿意 ❤</button>
      <button id="no">不愿意</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="result">
    <h2>我就知道！❤</h2>
    <p>瑶瑶，谢谢你愿意陪着我。<br />余生很长，我想和你一起走。<br />以后的每一个纪念日，都有我陪你过。</p>
  </div>

  <p class="sign">愿你每天都开开心心 ❤</p>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  // 飘落的爱心
  var canvas = document.getElementById('hearts');
  var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  var W, H, hearts = [];
  function resize() {
    W = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
    H = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;
  }
  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);
  resize();
  function newHeart() {
    return {
      x: Math.random() * W,
      y: -20,
      s: 10 + Math.random() * 18,
      v: 0.6 + Math.random() * 1.4,
      o: 0.35 + Math.random() * 0.5,
      w: Math.random() * 1.5
    };
  }
  for (var i = 0; i < 28; i++) {
    var h = newHeart();
    h.y = Math.random() * H;
    hearts.push(h);
  }
  function drawHeart(x, y, s, o) {
    ctx.save();
    ctx.globalAlpha = o;
    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff5c7a';
    ctx.translate(x, y);
    ctx.scale(s / 16, s / 16);
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(0, 5);
    ctx.bezierCurveTo(-9, -4, -4, -12, 0, -5);
    ctx.bezierCurveTo(4, -12, 9, -4, 0, 5);
    ctx.fill();
    ctx.restore();
  }
  (function loop() {
    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);
    for (var i = 0; i < hearts.length; i++) {
      var h = hearts[i];
      h.y += h.v;
      h.x += Math.sin((h.y / 60) + h.w) * 0.6;
      if (h.y > H + 20) hearts[i] = newHeart();
      drawHeart(h.x, h.y, h.s, h.o);
    }
    requestAnimationFrame(loop);
  })();

  // “不愿意”按钮会跑开
  var noBtn = document.getElementById('no');
  function dodge() {
    var x = Math.random() * 70;
    var y = Math.random() * 120 - 20;
    noBtn.style.left = x + '%';
    noBtn.style.top = y + 'px';
  }
  noBtn.addEventListener('mouseenter', dodge);
  noBtn.addEventListener('touchstart', function (e) { e.preventDefault(); dodge(); });
  noBtn.addEventListener('click', dodge);

  // 点“愿意”：撒花 + 揭晓
  document.getElementById('yes').addEventListener('click', function () {
    document.getElementById('question').style.display = 'none';
    var result = document.getElementById('result');
    result.style.display = 'block';
    for (var i = 0; i < 40; i++) {
      var h = newHeart();
      h.y = H * 0.7;
      h.x = W / 2 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 300;
      h.v = -(1 + Math.random() * 2);
      hearts.push(h);
    }
    result.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
